      propertyPath: objectiveToGive.Array.data[0]
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1411807486}
    - target: {fileID: 3493604527745461607, guid: 89b2ae7bccf9f426999e81c797e9ff4e,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: baseDialogue.Array.data[0].defaultText
      value: So I got a new puppy! I named him Sherlock Bones and he loves playing
        fetch!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3493604527745461607, guid: 89b2ae7bccf9f426999e81c797e9ff4e,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: baseDialogue.Array.data[1].defaultText
      value: Can u help run a super duper secret **ERRAND** for me? I completely
        lost **[color=#153CBF]JERRY'S[/color]** favorite **YELLOW PUSH-PIN** and
        I don't want him 2 find out. Can u help me find it pls?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3493604527745461607, guid: 89b2ae7bccf9f426999e81c797e9ff4e,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: baseDialogue.Array.data[2].defaultText
      value: Can you find my **YELLOW PUSH-PIN AND BRING IT BACK TO ME?**
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3493604527745461607, guid: 89b2ae7bccf9f426999e81c797e9ff4e,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: tertiaryDialogue.Array.data[0].defaultText
      value: '**[color=#153CBF]JERRY''S[/color]** gonna kill me if u don''t find
        it! :(('
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3493604527745461607, guid: 89b2ae7bccf9f426999e81c797e9ff4e,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: secondaryDialogue.Array.data[0].defaultText
      value: I last saw **[color=#153CBF]JERRY'S[/color]** **YELLOW PUSH-PIN** when
        I was drinking my Starbies on the top shelf.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
